{"message_id": 1208338914411028581, "created_at": "2024-02-17T09:07:27.047000+00:00", "author_id": 624440365595754496, "author_username": "austinbaustinb", "author_display": "Austin B [Records Director]", "content": "__Help feed the cats this semester and become a due paying member of the CCC!__ \nWhy pay membership dues? Once you pay, you can help out the cats on a more personal level! You can be a part of the feeding team and go out to the stations and feed them, be a part of our public relations and post for our instagram, help stay later in the evenings during our tnr sessions, etc! All of the money collected goes towards the cats and their well being and they love our support! <:cute:933104767348134018>\nWhen you pay your dues, you are added to MavOrgs as a member of the club and you have access to more chats in the Discord as well. \n\n\n__**Dues are either $15 a semester, or a physical donation of some sort, and there are 3 steps to paying them.**__\n## STEP ONE\nPaying the dues themselves! There are 5 ways you can do this,\n- On [Paypal](https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/utacampuscats)\n- On [Venmo](http://www.venmo.com/utacampuscats)\n- On [Cashapp](http://cash.app/$utacampuscats)\n- With cash: Contact an officer\n- With a donation of either a 25lb container of litter, a 14lbs bag/24 can case of adult or kitten food (for feeding), or TWO!! extra large towels or blankets (for TNR and fostering help).\nBe sure to message an officer to let us set up a dropoff spot to complete your donation.", "attachments": [], "referenced_message_id": null, "parsed": {"author_id": 624440365595754496, "author_name": "austinbaustinb", "author_display": "Austin B [Records Director]", "ts": "2024-02-17T09:07:27.047000+00:00", "content": "__Help feed the cats this semester and become a due paying member of the CCC!__ Why pay membership dues? Once you pay, you can help out the cats on a more personal level! You can be a part of the feeding team and go out to the stations and feed them, be a part of our public relations and post for our instagram, help stay later in the evenings during our tnr sessions, etc! All of the money collected goes towards the cats and their well being and they love our support! <:cute:933104767348134018> When you pay your dues, you are added to MavOrgs as a member of the club and you have access to more chats in the Discord as well. __**Dues are either $15 a semester, or a physical donation of some sort, and there are 3 steps to paying them.**__ ## STEP ONE Paying the dues themselves! There are 5 ways you can do this, - On [Paypal](https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/utacampuscats) - On [Venmo](http://www.venmo.com/utacampuscats) - On [Cashapp](http://cash.app/$utacampuscats) - With cash: Contact an officer - With a donation of either a 25lb container of litter, a 14lbs bag/24 can case of adult or kitten food (for feeding), or TWO!! extra large towels or blankets (for TNR and fostering help). Be sure to message an officer to let us set up a dropoff spot to complete your donation.", "provider": "paypal", "amounts": [15.0, 3.0, 5.0, 25.0, 14.0, 24.0], "handles": ["$utacampuscats"], "name": "https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/utacampuscats", "dues_hint": true, "donation_hint": true}}
{"message_id": 1208339311351562320, "created_at": "2024-02-17T09:09:01.685000+00:00", "author_id": 624440365595754496, "author_username": "austinbaustinb", "author_display": "Austin B [Records Director]", "content": "## STEP TWO\nFill out our membership application form! \nThis form helps us collect contact info, get to know you, find a fit for you in open positions we have, and is the main collection of all our membership info. It is linked [here](https://forms.gle/kmTfFPS93Nd8Do5j6)\nWe use this form to add you to our MavOrgs, and to give you your *Due Paying Members* role, so be sure to fill it out **every semester** you want to become an active member. For this, be sure to use your *UTA email*, and not your personal email. Without your UTA email, we can't add you as a member to MavOrgs.", "attachments": [], "referenced_message_id": null, "parsed": {"author_id": 624440365595754496, "author_name": "austinbaustinb", "author_display": "Austin B [Records Director]", "ts": "2024-02-17T09:09:01.685000+00:00", "content": "## STEP TWO Fill out our membership application form! This form helps us collect contact info, get to know you, find a fit for you in open positions we have, and is the main collection of all our membership info. It is linked [here](https://forms.gle/kmTfFPS93Nd8Do5j6) We use this form to add you to our MavOrgs, and to give you your *Due Paying Members* role, so be sure to fill it out **every semester** you want to become an active member. For this, be sure to use your *UTA email*, and not your personal email. Without your UTA email, we can't add you as a member to MavOrgs.", "provider": null, "amounts": [93.0, 8.0, 5.0, 6.0], "handles": [], "name": "https://forms.gle/kmTfFPS93Nd8Do5j6", "dues_hint": true, "donation_hint": false}}
{"message_id": 1208339345715634186, "created_at": "2024-02-17T09:09:09.878000+00:00", "author_id": 624440365595754496, "author_username": "austinbaustinb", "author_display": "Austin B [Records Director]", "content": "## STEP THREE\nMessage in this channel stating:\n- **Your full name** (Or if you paid online, the username your account is under)\n- **Where you paid** (See STEP ONE) This lets us know where to look to verify your membership\n\nThanks for helping the cats this semester!! We appreciate all of your support <:happycat:834819172546510868>", "attachments": [], "referenced_message_id": null, "parsed": {"author_id": 624440365595754496, "author_name": "austinbaustinb", "author_display": "Austin B [Records Director]", "ts": "2024-02-17T09:09:09.878000+00:00", "content": "## STEP THREE Message in this channel stating: - **Your full name** (Or if you paid online, the username your account is under) - **Where you paid** (See STEP ONE) This lets us know where to look to verify your membership Thanks for helping the cats this semester!! We appreciate all of your support <:happycat:834819172546510868>", "provider": null, "amounts": [], "handles": [], "name": "Or if you paid online, the username your account is under", "dues_hint": false, "donation_hint": false}}
